Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:03.70,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,发生了一件麻烦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.70,0:22:05.60,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请过来帮忙协助
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,依蕾奈 这里就拜托妳戒备了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:14.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:16.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我说你们
